# Contact form email delivery (https://resend.com)
#
# Setup:
# 1. Create a free Resend account and verify a sending domain (or use their
#    shared onboarding@resend.dev sender for testing).
# 2. Create an API key and set RESEND_API_KEY below.
# 3. Set CONTACT_TO_EMAIL to the inbox that should receive submissions.
# 4. Optionally set CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL once a domain is verified in Resend
#    (defaults to Resend's shared test sender otherwise).
#
# Until RESEND_API_KEY and CONTACT_TO_EMAIL are both set, the contact form
# will validate submissions correctly but will show a clear error instead of
# silently pretending the message was sent.

RESEND_API_KEY=
CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=
CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL="NordGate Website <onboarding@resend.dev>"
